<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Discover unique places to stay with WonderLust. Find your next escape, explore destinations, and share your space."><title>WonderLust — Find your place</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="WonderLust home"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="17"/><path d="m26 13-4 10-9 4 4-10z"/></svg>Wonder<span>Lust</span><b>.</b></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/listings">Explore stays</a><a href="#destinations">Destinations</a><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a></nav><div class="accounts"><a class="host-link" href="/listings/new">Become a host</a><a class="button small" href="<%= currUser ? '/profile' : '/login' %>"><%= currUser ? 'My profile' : 'Log in' %> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></header>
<main id="main">
<% if (success.length || error.length) { %><div class="wrap notices" role="status"><% [...success, ...error].forEach(message => { %><p><%= message %></p><% }); %></div><% } %>
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><img decoding="async" class="hero-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=75" alt="Wooden boat on a lake surrounded by mountains" width="2200" height="1400" fetchpriority="high"><div class="shade"></div><div class="hero-content"><h1 id="hero-title">A stay worth<br>wandering for.</h1><p>Discover homes, cabins, and little escapes.<br> Find somewhere you’ll love waking up.</p><form action="/listings" method="GET" role="search"><div class="search-field"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><label for="destination">Where to?</label><input id="destination" name="q" type="search" placeholder="City, country, or stay" maxlength="100"></div></div><button class="button" type="submit">Explore stays <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 5 5"/></svg></button></form></div><div class="caption"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div>A slower kind of somewhere<small>Go somewhere that stays with you.</small></div><p>WonderLust / Field notes</p></div></section>
<div class="search-wrap wrap"><div class="quick-search"><span>A little inspiration:</span><a href="/listings?q=Bali">Bali</a><a href="/listings?q=Goa">Goa</a><a href="/listings?q=Manali">Manali</a><a href="/listings?q=Paris">Paris</a></div></div>
<section class="destinations wrap" id="destinations" aria-labelledby="destination-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2 id="destination-title">Follow your curiosity.</h2><p>Pick a feeling. Find a place. Make it your own.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/listings">Explore all stays <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="destination-grid">
<% const destinations = [{name:'Bali',country:'Indonesia',note:'A little tropical daydream',image:'photo-1537996194471-e657df975ab4'},{name:'Manali',country:'India',note:'Take the scenic route',image:'photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b'},{name:'Goa',country:'India',note:'Life on beach time',image:'photo-1512343879784-a960bf40e7f2'},{name:'Paris',country:'France',note:'Get lost in the lovely details',image:'photo-1502602898657-3e91760cbb34'}]; destinations.forEach(destination => { %><a class="destination-card" href="/listings?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(destination.name) %>"><div class="destination-photo"><img decoding="async" src="https://images.unsplash.com/<%= destination.image %>?auto=format&fit=crop&w=650&q=80" alt="<%= destination.name %> destination inspiration" width="650" height="800" loading="lazy"><span class="country"><%= destination.country %></span><span class="card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3><%= destination.name %></h3><p><%= destination.note %></p></a><% }); %>
</div></section>
<section class="how" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="wrap how-layout"><div><h2 id="how-title">Less planning.<br>More living.</h2><p class="intro">From the first “what if” to the moment you arrive, find your way to somewhere special.</p><a class="text-link" href="/listings">Let's get you there <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="steps"><article><div><h3>Find your somewhere</h3><p>Browse destinations and discover a stay that matches your mood.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Make yourself at home</h3><p>Explore the photos, read guest reviews, and choose the details that matter to you.</p></div></article><article><div><h3>Let the adventure begin</h3><p>Choose your dates, book your stay, and make room for new memories.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="host wrap" aria-labelledby="host-title"><img decoding="async" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1449158743715-0a90ebb6d2d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Welcoming cabin surrounded by trees" width="1000" height="700" loading="lazy"><div><h2 id="host-title">Open your door.<br>Share your world.</h2><p class="intro">Have a cosy corner, a city hideaway, or a home with a view? Open your door to someone’s next adventure.</p><a class="button" href="/listings/new">Become a host <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</main><footer class="wrap"><div><a class="footer-brand" href="/">WonderLust<span>.</span></a><p>Somewhere new. Something unforgettable.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><a href="/listings">Explore stays</a><a href="/listings/new">Become a host</a><a href="<%= currUser ? '/profile' : '/signup' %>"><%= currUser ? 'Your account' : 'Join WonderLust' %></a></div><div class="footer-bottom"><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> WonderLust. All rights reserved.</span><span>Made for the wonder in you ↗</span></div></footer><script src="/js/images.js" defer></script><script src="/js/reveal.js" defer></script>
</body></html>
